It is always a good practice to have a catch block with an exception class reference at the last. This will ensure that if the exception generated is missed
by the above catch block, the last catch will always handle the exception. 

Exception Handling - Handling Exception is such a way that if doesn't cause abrupt termination of a program.
we can handle exception  by using the following three ways:
