Treeset will internally make use of Skewed binary search tree. For Binary Search tree , if data is given in ascending order, then it becomes
skewed binary search tree. It is not efficient in searching. Skewed binary tree would be converted balance binary search tree by using red-black
algorithm. 

TreeSet internally store data in balance binary search tree and when data is retrieved inorder traversal technique would be applied on the 
balance binary search tree and data would be displayed in ascending order. Hence for all practical purposes , we can say that treeset stores the
data in ascending order. 

